Comment: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也是第一次跟超能力者幹架啊
Comment: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我很期待...
Comment: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,槍?
Comment: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,檢查完成
Comment: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂對於初次實戰表現出幹勁
Comment: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說 上面發出了可以對你開槍的許可
Comment: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的可以嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來 開始第一次實驗吧
Comment: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 我要先發制人了
Comment: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂開始攻擊
Comment: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,彈道被偏移了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂暫時拉開距離 分析...
Comment: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這丫頭是在開玩笑嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂
Comment: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是怎麼回事?
Comment: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.36,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(887,980)}Level 5
Comment: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的是超能力者的複製人嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.96,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fscx77\pos(646,980)}Oringinal
Comment: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和原型的性能差異 你就別深究了
Comment: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 複製人們會透過網路共享記憶
Comment: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們會在這兩萬次戰鬥中不斷學習 進化
Comment: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到最後 即使是你也可能會陷入苦戰唷
Comment: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,反過來說 必須一直跟這些雜魚打了?
Comment: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,切 很沒勁啊
Comment: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次只有她一個吧?
Comment: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是 不過
Comment: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,第一次實驗還沒有結束
Comment: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到你處理完你身後的那具實驗體
Comment: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,透過處理兩萬具武裝過後的複製人
Comment: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個實驗才會完美成功
Comment: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目標還沒有停止活動
Comment: 0,0:12:57.05,0:12:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,繼續戰鬥
Comment: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明白...了
Comment: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,繼續實驗
Comment: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂遵從命令
Comment: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,處理? 停止活動?
Comment: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說...
Comment: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好暗...
Comment: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好深...
Comment: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就像...沉入水中一樣...
Comment: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這就是...「死」嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂...
Comment: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來是這麼回事啊
Comment: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯 辛苦了
Comment: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,第一次實驗就此結束
Comment: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一開始可能很無聊
Comment: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但她們會不斷變強 你就狠狠地處理掉她們吧
Comment: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不用顧忌
Comment: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對手只是藥品和蛋白質構成的
Comment: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,區區的人偶罷了
Comment: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好了
Comment: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去買個飯吃吧
Comment: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御...御坂?
Comment: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像有事件發生了
Comment: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像死人了
Comment: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼 殺人案?
Comment: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 還沒到嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,馬上到
Comment: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不...那麼...這裡...
Comment: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該有屍...屍體的
Comment: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊?
Comment: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 你真的有看到嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼? 騙人的吧...
Comment: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是夢? 不可能
Comment: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是 這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明白
Comment: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂
Comment: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們檢查了所有這附近的監視器
Comment: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有發現任何可疑的事件
Comment: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會...
Comment: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是剛剛...
Comment: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次我們就和上頭報告是目擊者搞錯了
Comment: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 再有下次我們就會聯絡你學校了喔
Comment: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 竟然玩這種惡劣的惡作劇
Comment: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發生什麼事了...
Comment: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發生什麼事了啊? 可惡
Comment: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御...御坂?
Comment: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常抱歉
Comment: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原本預定工作完後就回到你那邊
Comment: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂先道歉道
Comment: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一下!
Comment: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我可以認為妳是...御坂妹吧?
Comment: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡 結果到底發生什麼事了啊?
Comment: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉 直到剛剛我還認為妳死了
Comment: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了
Comment: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂確實已經死了喔
Comment: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂報告道
Comment: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...那是...
Comment: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳抱著什麼?
Comment: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以防萬一 先確認一下密碼
Comment: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂言出必行道
Comment: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,ZXC741 ASD852 QWE963'
Comment: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂試探著你
Comment: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼...?
Comment: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從你不能解讀出剛才的密碼能看出
Comment: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你並不是本實驗的相關人員吧
Comment: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂做出結論
Comment: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳一直在說什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那睡袋裡面到底裝了什麼?
Comment: 0,0:17:58.38,0:17:59.49,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)\fscx92}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:17:58.38,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是「妹妹」喔
Comment: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂回答道
Comment: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,關於棄黑貓於不顧這件事情 我們道歉
Comment: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂說道
Comment: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 我們不願意將動物牽扯進這種爭鬥中
Comment: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂辯解道
Comment: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來因為本實驗
Comment: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓你多擔心了呢
Comment: 0,0:18:24.09,0:18:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂道歉道
Comment: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 你不用擔心
Comment: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在場的御坂
Comment: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是御坂
Comment: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...怎麼回事?
Comment: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你直到剛剛一直在接觸的御坂
Comment: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是編號10032
Comment: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是 我這個御坂
Comment: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而今天死亡的是編號10031
Comment: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是昨天你和姐姐大人一起遇到的
Comment: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂說明道
Comment: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂應用操縱電力的能力
Comment: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓彼此的腦波相連
Comment: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,共享著記憶
Comment: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂補充說明道
Comment: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們...到底是什麼?
Comment: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.72,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1236,980)}Level 5
Comment: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市僅有的七名超能力者
Comment: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,作為御坂美琴姐姐大人的
Comment: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,軍用量產型 而被製造出來的
Comment: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,體細胞複製人
Comment: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.13,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「妹妹們」
Comment: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂回答道
Comment: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂的...複製人?
Comment: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...
Comment: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們...在做什麼...
Comment: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是實驗而已
Comment: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂回答道
Comment: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由於詳細情形是機密事項
Comment: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法對你說明
Comment: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之沒有危險性
Comment: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂解釋道
Comment: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於將你牽扯進本次實驗中 再次道歉
Comment: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂低頭道歉道
Comment: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 貓就拜託你了
Comment: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是實驗而已
Comment: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,作為御坂美琴姐姐大人的
Comment: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,軍用量產型 而被製造出來的
Comment: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,體細胞複製人
Comment: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗?
Comment: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,軍用?
Comment: 0,0:20:32.32,0:20:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她...御坂她...
Comment: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道這件事情嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.52,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(900,980)}Level6 Shift
Comment: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對能力進化計畫
Comment: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:51.93,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(991,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,透過殺害超電磁砲128次
Comment: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.31,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1085,980)}Level 6
Comment: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以進化為絕對能力者...
Comment: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對啊
Comment: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼做就行了
Comment: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:25.63,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,下一站是 第七學區 常盤台中學學生宿舍前
Comment: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:28.39,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,下一站是 第七學區 常盤台...
Comment: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,208號室
Comment: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,見到了她 我又能怎麼做?
Comment: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要問她那個毫不在乎地殺人的可怕實驗內容嗎?
Comment: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:22.19,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:32.30,下一回,next,0,0,0,,
